<title>POLAND: ZREW STARTS BOURSE TRADE AT PLN 76.</title>
<headline>ZREW STARTS BOURSE TRADE AT PLN 76.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish power equipment repairer Zaklady Remontowe Energetyki Warszawa SA (ZREW) started trade on the parallel market of the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday at 76 zlotys.</p>
<p>The company, which has 778,496 shares listed on the exchange, did not carry out an initial public offering.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
